WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.467
-The last time you were here
was a big deal.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:05.667
It was the first time
you were nominated for a Grammy.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.501
And I think the first time
you were on our show,

00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:09.200
you were like,
"I really want a Grammy."

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.667
Now you're five-time-nominated
for a Grammy.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.467
-Oh, wow.
-Come on. That's --

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:17.434
Congratulations!
-Thank you. Thank you, Jimmy.

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:23.868
We could be nominated thanks to
our fans' great support.

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:25.200
I appreciate them.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

